394
00:24:50,694 --> 00:24:51,713
Lo ves mal.

395
00:24:52,059 --> 00:24:53,102
Dios.

396
00:24:53,363 --> 00:24:54,532
Lo ves mal.

397
00:24:54,727 --> 00:24:56,382
Cógeme la mano.

398
00:24:56,599 --> 00:24:58,563
Aprieta tan fuerte como quieras

399
00:24:58,623 --> 00:25:00,165
